WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A whole hour is sixty minutes. The long hand makes one complete trip around the clock.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Half of sixty is thirty. So half an hour is thirty minutes.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
After half a trip, the long hand reaches six. Thirty minutes have passed.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:37.000
The short hand has passed three. It is halfway to four. The hour is still three.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Say it together: half past three. That means thirty minutes after three: three thirty.
